          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lokulungisa izinkwa ezahlukaniselwa uNkulunkulu lempuphu yomnikelo wempuphu, lezinkwa ezingelamvubelo, lezinkwa zokosiwa, lenhlama, lezilinganiso zonke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azakuba khona insuku zonke ekuseni abonge adumise iNkosi, enze njalo lantambama, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "langazo zonke izikhathi zokunikelwa komnikelo wokutshiswa eNkosini ngamaSabatha, langezikhathi zokuthwasa kwenyanga, langensuku zemikhosi, njengokumiswa kwenani lawo. Azakuwenzela iNkosi lumsebenzi kokuphela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azakugcina ithente lokuhlangana, lendlu engcwele, asize amadodana kaAroni izihlobo zawo, enkonzweni yethempeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.32",
